                  "kind": "letters",
                  "emoji": "🦆 🦅",
                  "label": "a picture"
                }
              },
              {
                "stage": "explain",
                "text": "Adaptations are features or behaviours that help a living thing survive in its habitat: to get food, escape predators, keep warm, or save water."
